\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Written values are retrieved through attention to their token, across the middle third of layers. (A)~Blocking later positions' attention to the edited value's token drops edit use to zero on four models; matched control blocks change nothing. (B)~Overwriting the hidden state at any single layer before the read redirects the answer; after it, nothing (Qwen3-4B). (C)~Blocking attention across the shaded middle band removes most edit use; no single layer's block matters (gray dots).}}{5}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:retrieval}{{4}{5}{Written values are retrieved through attention to their token, across the middle third of layers. (A)~Blocking later positions' attention to the edited value's token drops edit use to zero on four models; matched control blocks change nothing. (B)~Overwriting the hidden state at any single layer before the read redirects the answer; after it, nothing (Qwen3-4B). (C)~Blocking attention across the shaded middle band removes most edit use; no single layer's block matters (gray dots)}{figure.4}{}}
